{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RetryPolicy","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PersistenceMiddlewareGuide"]},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Retrying matters because the buffers are cleared at flush time: without it a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"failed save only ever reaches disk if the user happens to touch the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entity again, which is silent data loss. Retrying ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"forever"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" matters just as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"much in the other direction — a write that can never succeed (disk full, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"model the container can’t encode, a schema mismatch) must not keep the stack","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"busy indefinitely. So attempts are bounded, and running out is an event the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app can see rather than a silence.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/RetryPolicy"},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/RetryPolicy\/init(maxAttempts:baseDelay:maxDelay:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/RetryPolicy\/baseDelay","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/RetryPolicy\/maxAttempts","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/RetryPolicy\/maxDelay"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"generated":true,"title":"Type Pro